WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:03.146
Click any text on a slide to rewrite it.

00:00:03.279 --> 00:00:06.223
The text resizes itself to fit the layout.

00:00:07.436 --> 00:00:15.534
Edit with AI rewrites a slide from a one-line instruction, and shows the same content in other layouts, so you can switch with a click.

00:00:15.888 --> 00:00:17.949
It never changes your photos.

00:00:21.920 --> 00:00:23.772
Click a photo to replace it.

00:00:23.963 --> 00:00:29.809
Choose from the Giga library, upload your own, or render a live map of any country.

00:00:29.803 --> 00:00:32.062
Drag the photo to reframe it.

00:00:34.144 --> 00:00:36.461
Icons are picked to match each card.

00:00:36.536 --> 00:00:40.153
To change one, click it and search the full icon set.

00:00:41.461 --> 00:00:43.499
Click a chart to open its data.

00:00:43.574 --> 00:00:48.863
Edit the values, rename the series, or add a row, and the chart updates as you type.

00:00:49.113 --> 00:00:53.125
On a progress slide, click a stage to mark it as in progress.

00:00:53.200 --> 00:00:55.447
Everything before it shows as done.

00:00:55.698 --> 00:00:59.013
Add an element to a slide, or hover one and delete it.

00:00:59.088 --> 00:01:01.196
Undo brings anything back.

00:01:03.038 --> 00:01:05.749
Drag the thumbnails to reorder the deck.

00:01:05.778 --> 00:01:10.022
When it is ready, press play to present, or download it.
